{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2f77c31d3b465ee14e9fdd6c78b9cf5d48c530c3cefcddc8b08c313b7bf24917","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_58fdb60b12ba7376d04cf4fa89a31a7657eb7873e78d4b44c947331b6eb74533","slc_f6e97e8922ba79848002c001f1c8aebbcfe4fb9d2b242aa0f5cb7fe331e38a3f"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"An optional dedicated memory model can be set with /model 2 <provider:model> for post-turn memory extraction; otherwise extraction uses the current primary model.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_50c7b2d60fa403a472432d1fdce9d4a4dcf8f7b757fd67dd54cfaf32afea78a1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=components","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7a7366d6e9ee4bd782919330269da8222be44f89f8b36ff4cc21678a387c95d7"],"source_ids":["src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"The architecture docs indicate sandboxing is pluggable: a sandbox provider protocol and factory exist, with cloud providers including AWS Bedrock AgentCore and LangSmith sandboxes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_52ad87263acd07224c23139442359f3f3061e9e49731509cd6db89420a1a8187","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_394b070ecf5bdbe54d272c91c552a7ecff7278d32555c41f51388ea9307f0bd1","slc_7764506a70f628590b1226b2167a9b2d8164555ad8bb5160f4238016632bdac9","slc_a675e47bfc513f27430abbbf169fcdd665df6d234c40286d866982bcaad6fa31"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"The WeCom bot daemon is configured with WECOM_BOT_ID and WECOM_BOT_SECRET environment variables, optionally overrides WECOM_WS_URL (default wss://openws.work.weixin.qq.com), and runs project-scoped remote turns and scheduled-task delivery.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5537d5302129a49ebc86a9e3ce5655bf575f7ccd3d03a77e52aa7fb3bdecf9d8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_53861a30d722380e230e8c50073bda33929b5712e125c836fa8c68fa845906fc","slc_724c12f294e3ed80522615c1e41bd609cdd3887d6a74067c5746d8802ec9ec60","slc_9b09fa8ed448f729b260dec8532d2193af4997fe12287c220daf10478a70d12a"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"Document-oriented skills rely on optional extras (invincat-cli[pdf], [office], [all-skills]) and may need system tools such as LibreOffice, Poppler, Tesseract, or Node.js packages.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70318a9f4bd124c571269dc995a5b6d5d9f3ade61602339fb46c698f1d01cf53","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8b0fcb838b8d44c5296229adec2ac037dfc97af18537ece8b451faca0b92104a","slc_cd5cee4acfbf0f9542d63f655e18aa655f75e5059e25e868f63d43263e75af5c"],"source_ids":["src_6beca8f1ded65be2850c3c252ddf2f60","src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"The package supports both interactive Textual TUI and non-interactive runtime paths, plus a local LangGraph server mode and ACP startup wiring, selected from parsed CLI arguments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70e242a815658fb666d835516dcef64a98452e034e82f6e5d82d3828b2b7dd71","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_600ecbf5f00f8910ac5bd02e750e52b833f29f4868914519b743e20f8848fc93","slc_b104833af8c9931cd761eafe02407f23c17c53ec4a1ea8aa8d9fc65156a89d61"],"source_ids":["src_6beca8f1ded65be2850c3c252ddf2f60","src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"MCP integration includes server loading/connection, tool wrapping, and an MCP server trust policy module (mcp/trust.py).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9c6ff3f6c070b0cdf691928bac878cdfd0fae1952203d800d4d1dd18a35e6c2d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3173a3592bd8a8595c482137098e2227b1271f74f3a78629b57b0972b1c224ff","slc_fcff36f52c9b3736779a383274b4fe0e13f5e15e4e16123381e827de728b22dc"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"Built-in subagents callable via the task tool include explorer (read-only codebase exploration), worker (bounded implementation), researcher (external research), and document-worker (document parsing/extraction for PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, Markdown, CSV, JSON).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9cb53f6cc8cd933fb2d8a7a81deaa2bc555b30356c9d0e9aa8427eb36029fec9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4bc1c60fa8488b715a00a4ff0d05a7f04a124f95bbe29e68ed6caa0f1803871b","slc_b60f9da85ba256c76e154e1fc5fdb8d985c42337feebd0a1efbd6663530dc2a9"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"The product exposes slash commands including /model, /plan, /goal, /memory, /schedule, /mcp, /threads, and /help, plus a wecombot subcommand to start the WeCom daemon.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9db1c58409ca0c3ed001fccbe1746aa7d23f303cb899e8938945888468f58adc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7c273d907b71de1a2292db914f7cd7fd30fdcc7e551ec7cf7afe7ef51e3dd37e","slc_ffb22ec3f80633fc48cb307a84057a049e1c4f74873ae5ff469a70509d6bff67"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"File reads, edits, creation, and shell command execution are approval-gated, with shell commands running under configurable safety controls.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a8b2614e58bba5b8f0daac26b84143b28a6d1aad8bcdd4c683e195f2f1aa0648","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0032bafc50c7e324e2644e68d4210aaeabd3d3a36c5b70ca504fcdcf077d7356","slc_09dff3f03d818327de4c769170b62fe3233d84c4333f0c2ebeb8f950389142df","slc_67e6867a15fc9c2011ea4daf50ef2d424dd38b904b25af27a1523fc336fc3f96"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"Model configuration is done via a /model manager (Ctrl+N to register provider, model name, API key, optional base URL) or through provider environment variables such as OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, and OPENROUTER_API_KEY.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b5aae266459120dffad5efd8b7c0f413115035e6d15e1751c689f99fb4482685","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_51a484f41a91e8aa0e58ca299601a522e98b45c60a7a7ab439c8c076a4fd9640","slc_8b4df2a3b0e6a95d5b6384f28ad6c5aa2450803019b483b5bd10bcb16b52e217"],"source_ids":["src_6beca8f1ded65be2850c3c252ddf2f60","src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"Middleware includes approve_plan and ask_user interrupt protocols, auto memory refresh, project-scoped file management tools (file_info, mkdir, move_file, copy_file, delete_file), micro_compaction of old messages, and token state tracking.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c19110a154cc7f2e96fccca5068880a5cdb5189932ff81c9932858a6d6915b94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b22b85820048ffa7bd24e8335e0ccdeec62d5a5de29657373d27bd091adee189","slc_c1d72eb5f150c47a8d6764eb50e091196114762c0e4231ad1866da58d05f689f"],"source_ids":["src_6beca8f1ded65be2850c3c252ddf2f60","src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"Model selection is per-call switchable through LangGraph runtime context via configurable_model, and model profiles persist as TOML configuration with thread-level model preferences.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c389cfa7030c09cd1461982c9f298920b67c3b35af8b413438c42436db3b840b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_81be372932ae8fdd8a6dbf292517c56a91224fdb1a92efabaad2da09707f8943","slc_a837cc7dde3e84a3a0e27330a598b7aa1b8430d9be9ac44b830b2ad2d268275a"],"source_ids":["src_6beca8f1ded65be2850c3c252ddf2f60","src_c3717b463770596cab35c02d1f610d81"],"text":"The runtime is a Textual TUI over a DeepAgents/LangGraph agent: cli assembles startup, agent builds the agent with tools/middleware/backend/system prompt, textual_adapter converts agent streams to UI messages, and widgets render chat, tool calls, approvals, and selectors.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cdc2529264955c6e45527d768d01f4c9147d82f6fa24ecdc9b71bb329420dd3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"dog-qiuqiu/invincat@8a026ea3579a snapshot aeb151f89aa5de23","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1ca615c0491c1531c66940a8d5a57a754cce41ec59be0da60ee7621a8b2680f1","slc_255b77f6af2eb5e7e5269237207aa84a9a29e5eaabaf5cb7f9f822bcd30e9707","slc_30a33da31e6e0cf26c50b16cb32725f6cff7c74d46b87a827a83f61c7ec9d7a4","slc_87a1d094214cabbcb889cc3033092de9fdc21418d9f0d895c6aeff109ba24fc8"],"source_ids":["src_ebe281ab90775f0db77af65a68f16f2a"],"text":"The package is distributed on PyPI as invincat-cli, requires Python 3.11+, and can also be installed from source via an editable pip install.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:06:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_27c2675c1f484f3993995713272f26d7"}
